Error [jet.UnusedPlaceMark]: `.move()` can't take a field out of a collection element
  --> tests/ui/move_mark_element_field.jet:14:13
    |
 14 |     tags := items[0].tags.move()
    |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: An element stays owned by its collection together with every field inside it, so this value can only be a copy
 Fix: Call `.copy()` on the field instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0225

